WEBVTT

00:00:44.310 --> 00:00:46.210
Don't be so nervous.

00:00:46.210 --> 00:00:47.980
Uh... okay.

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.940
Roan, just in case...

00:00:49.940 --> 00:00:50.540
Huh?

00:00:55.850 --> 00:00:58.220
Look after Yuufa.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:01:00.420
Huh?

00:01:00.420 --> 00:01:01.650
Okay!

00:01:18.340 --> 00:01:20.780
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:01:20.780 --> 00:01:24.750
<i>We dash across the skies</i>

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:27.250
<i>You are my star</i>

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:31.750
<i>A priceless love</i>

00:01:31.750 --> 00:01:37.560
<i>El Dorado,</i> <i>rising up above the dust clouds</i>

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:41.500
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:01:45.530 --> 00:01:49.600
<i>The dream I saw before I awoke</i>

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:56.910
<i>Will surely come true, so never forget it</i>

00:01:58.380 --> 00:02:02.450
<i>Searching for a sliver in time passing by</i>

00:02:02.450 --> 00:02:09.580
<i>Where I belong, those days are over now</i>

00:02:11.090 --> 00:02:15.060
<i>Silhouettes outlining the shapes of clouds</i>

00:02:15.060 --> 00:02:17.500
<i>Farther and farther</i>

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:24.440
<i>I want to keep looking for</i> <i>the promised land I saw in my dreams</i>

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:26.710
<i>We are the stars</i>

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:30.780
<i>Like a shining arrow</i>

00:02:30.780 --> 00:02:33.280
<i>You are my star</i>

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:37.820
<i>Unfailing strength</i>

00:02:37.820 --> 00:02:43.630
<i>The panorama that spreads before us,</i> <i>beyond the darkness</i>

00:02:43.630 --> 00:02:46.530
<i>We are journey to the stars</i>

00:03:00.440 --> 00:03:02.440
Here we go...

00:03:02.440 --> 00:03:07.050
We'll hold onto the sticky liquid and the earthworm skin.

00:03:07.050 --> 00:03:09.620
Thank you very much.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.390
Kapra Service is always there for you.

00:03:13.390 --> 00:03:14.590
I'm counting on you!

00:03:14.590 --> 00:03:16.320
No!

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:18.660
Not inside!

00:03:18.660 --> 00:03:23.670
Don't say that, come on.
It will get dark soon.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:25.770
Let's go inside already.

00:03:25.770 --> 00:03:29.870
No! I'm not going in there!

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:30.970
Yuufa!

00:03:30.970 --> 00:03:33.810
No, no, no!

00:03:33.810 --> 00:03:35.610
My brother is alive!

00:03:35.610 --> 00:03:38.280
I'm going to go look for him!

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:40.680
Ouch...

00:03:42.050 --> 00:03:44.620
Aah... Such a kid.

00:03:44.620 --> 00:03:46.390
It's all your fault!

00:03:46.390 --> 00:03:49.220
What? Why is it my fault?

00:03:49.220 --> 00:03:52.830
You're the one that said
Sis' Big Brother is alive.

00:03:52.830 --> 00:03:58.370
Just a minute! I never said anything like that!

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:02.570
All I said was that the guy who fought with Iruga was named Keough.

00:04:02.570 --> 00:04:03.500
Don't make things up!

00:04:03.500 --> 00:04:05.970
That's why it's your fault!

00:04:05.970 --> 00:04:07.380
Ooh, so scary....

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.540
Iruga, say something.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:12.410
At this rate, I'm going to end up being the bad guy.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:13.640
Hmph!

00:04:16.450 --> 00:04:18.320
This is useless.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.790
How are you going to find Keough?

00:04:22.790 --> 00:04:26.760
Well... I'll go to Oak Village!

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.560
That's where you saw him, right?

00:04:29.560 --> 00:04:31.330
That's a waste of time.

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:34.370
You can't go to Oak Village now.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:37.470
If you're going, you have to pack properly.

00:04:37.470 --> 00:04:39.710
Besides, it's getting dark.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:40.170
Let's go inside this inn!

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:43.040
No! I'm going now.
If we hurry...

00:04:43.040 --> 00:04:44.680
Stop it! It's not possible.

00:04:44.680 --> 00:04:46.710
Please!

00:04:46.710 --> 00:04:49.920
Roan! Go with me...

00:04:49.920 --> 00:04:51.290
Please!

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:54.090
Huh? Me, too?

00:04:54.090 --> 00:04:57.430
I said no. I can't possibly do that!

00:04:57.430 --> 00:04:59.430
Oh? In that case, never mind.

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.900
I'll go by myself.

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:03.900
Stop talking nonsense!

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.930
No! I'm going! I said I'm going!

00:05:05.930 --> 00:05:09.300
I'm going! I'm going! I'm going!

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:41.300
But... why?

00:05:41.300 --> 00:05:42.600
Roan!

00:05:42.600 --> 00:05:44.270
Have you calmed down?

00:05:44.270 --> 00:05:46.810
Huh? Uh, yes...

00:05:46.810 --> 00:05:49.840
I know how you feel.

00:05:49.840 --> 00:05:53.580
But, use your common sense.

00:05:53.580 --> 00:05:59.680
The world isn't so small that you can just walk around aimlessly.

00:06:00.960 --> 00:06:03.020
But, I...

00:06:03.020 --> 00:06:05.960
I want to find my brother!

00:06:27.280 --> 00:06:29.310
Big Brother...

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:35.390
Yuufa...

00:06:35.390 --> 00:06:36.980
Big Brother...

00:07:02.220 --> 00:07:05.850
Yuufa finally fell asleep.

00:07:05.850 --> 00:07:08.390
Sorry about that earlier incident.

00:07:08.390 --> 00:07:12.790
To calm her down, that's all
I could think of doing.

00:07:12.790 --> 00:07:14.500
My apologies.

00:07:14.500 --> 00:07:17.290
That's okay.

00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:32.970
Really? Is Keough really alive?

00:07:37.850 --> 00:07:42.260
Tell me! Is he really?

00:07:42.260 --> 00:07:44.660
Yeah, he's...

00:07:48.060 --> 00:07:50.130
That guy's not Keough.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:53.400
It's Haze.

00:07:53.400 --> 00:07:55.140
Haze?

00:07:55.140 --> 00:07:57.940
Yeah, he's a troublemaker.

00:07:57.940 --> 00:07:59.110
Trouble?

00:07:59.110 --> 00:08:00.210
Listen!

00:08:00.210 --> 00:08:05.550
Our job is to keep peace in the world and fight for justice!

00:08:05.550 --> 00:08:06.910
Yes...

00:08:06.910 --> 00:08:11.550
That's why we travel with
Iruga looking for evil-doers.

00:08:11.550 --> 00:08:13.720
Enough said.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:15.090
<i>At that rate...</i>

00:08:15.090 --> 00:08:18.090
<i>The human race will be wiped</i> <i>off the face of the Earth.</i>

00:08:18.090 --> 00:08:20.900
If you say that, we'll...

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.960
Hey, are you listening?

00:08:24.500 --> 00:08:28.840
Uh, yes! Judia-<i>san</i>?

00:08:28.840 --> 00:08:32.940
You guys, what is your relationship to my Iruga?

00:08:32.940 --> 00:08:37.710
That girl and Iruga partied together.

00:08:37.710 --> 00:08:41.180
So, that means you were there, right?

00:08:41.180 --> 00:08:44.310
Uh, well...

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:49.090
It's true that Yuufa and I,

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:55.000
and Yuufa's Big Brother Keough and Iruga-<i>san</i> partied together.

00:09:05.310 --> 00:09:07.540
Yuufa and I are childhood friends,

00:09:07.540 --> 00:09:11.950
and Keough-<i>san</i> and Iruga-<i>san</i> are old friends.

00:09:13.010 --> 00:09:15.010
Ah! Pupa!

00:09:25.860 --> 00:09:26.950
Why you...

00:09:55.760 --> 00:09:56.990
Yuufa!

00:10:11.540 --> 00:10:15.340
Big Brother Keough...
Thank you!

00:10:32.360 --> 00:10:34.130
Look, Big Brother.

00:10:34.130 --> 00:10:37.670
From today, I'm an acolyte too, right?

00:10:37.670 --> 00:10:39.030
Look, look!

00:10:49.710 --> 00:10:52.950
After Yuufa became an acolyte at Prontera,

00:10:52.950 --> 00:10:57.040
I went to Izrut to take my swordsman test.

00:11:07.130 --> 00:11:12.000
I wanted to be like Keough-<i>san</i> and protect Yuufa.

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:23.340
Then, one day...

00:11:27.210 --> 00:11:29.220
Glast Heim?!

00:11:29.220 --> 00:11:31.250
That's right.
It's a dangerous journey.

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:33.190
You two wait at Prontera.

00:11:33.190 --> 00:11:34.760
No! We don't want to!

00:11:34.760 --> 00:11:37.220
That's right!
We're going with you!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.690
But...

00:11:47.200 --> 00:11:52.410
Okay. But, if there's any trouble you must return.

00:11:52.410 --> 00:11:54.910
--All right!
--All right!

00:11:54.910 --> 00:11:59.040
But, because of our selfish request...

00:12:08.160 --> 00:12:09.990
Ah! Keough-<i>san</i>!

00:12:12.430 --> 00:12:14.360
Iruga-<i>san</i>!

00:12:14.360 --> 00:12:16.330
Wait! Big Brother!

00:12:17.770 --> 00:12:21.000
Go! Yuufa! Go!

00:12:24.770 --> 00:12:26.330
No!

00:12:47.260 --> 00:12:48.700
Big Brother...

00:13:02.610 --> 00:13:06.310
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:13:07.950 --> 00:13:10.320
Big Brother Keough!

00:13:16.520 --> 00:13:17.960
Yuufa!

00:13:17.960 --> 00:13:19.320
Big Brother!

00:13:25.470 --> 00:13:26.660
Here...

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:32.910
Waa! Thank you!

00:13:32.910 --> 00:13:36.640
Big Brother, is it true that you're going away?

00:13:36.640 --> 00:13:38.450
Hm? Yeah.

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:41.850
But, why? Why?

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.350
Big Brother!

00:13:48.720 --> 00:13:51.290
Yuufa, the sky sure is big, isn't it?

00:13:51.290 --> 00:13:53.390
Huh?

00:13:53.390 --> 00:13:59.200
So that we can ensure a peaceful time without any fighting under this sky,

00:13:59.200 --> 00:14:02.470
your brother needs to become stronger.

00:14:02.470 --> 00:14:04.630
Peaceful time?

00:14:07.210 --> 00:14:08.970
Big Brother!

00:14:11.810 --> 00:14:13.300
Big Brother?

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:18.480
Big Brother! Big Brother!

00:14:44.040 --> 00:14:45.670
It's morning already?

00:14:51.350 --> 00:14:56.350
It can't be helped,
Yuufa's just not a morning person.

00:14:57.730 --> 00:15:00.030
Yuufa! Wake up!

00:15:00.030 --> 00:15:03.830
Huh? Wha-? Yuufa?

00:15:03.830 --> 00:15:04.800
Yuufa?

00:15:06.470 --> 00:15:08.830
Yuufa? Yuufa?

00:15:10.240 --> 00:15:12.640
Don't tell me Yuufa's...

00:15:19.350 --> 00:15:20.080
Are you awake?

00:15:20.080 --> 00:15:21.820
Iruga-<i>san</i>! Yuufa...

00:15:21.820 --> 00:15:22.980
This is bad!

00:15:22.980 --> 00:15:25.980
Iruga-<i>san</i>, this is bad. Yuufa is...

00:15:28.360 --> 00:15:30.480
What's going on?

00:15:37.630 --> 00:15:41.200
<i>My brother is alive...</i>
<i>I'm sure of it...</i>

00:15:41.200 --> 00:15:44.330
<i>Wait for me, Brother Keough.</i>
<i>I'm on my way!</i>

00:15:48.840 --> 00:15:54.680
But, if my brother is alive, why doesn't he come to see me?

00:15:57.690 --> 00:15:59.020
Who is it?

00:16:02.560 --> 00:16:03.960
Goblins!

00:16:10.430 --> 00:16:11.960
Holy Light!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:17.630
I did it!

00:16:21.040 --> 00:16:22.630
It's the goblin leader!

00:16:30.720 --> 00:16:31.980
Stop it!

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:34.650
Let go of me!

00:17:01.980 --> 00:17:03.450
Could it be?

00:17:04.820 --> 00:17:12.290
Big Brother!

00:17:14.830 --> 00:17:17.300
Big Brother Keough!

00:17:25.470 --> 00:17:27.540
Big... Brother?

00:17:33.680 --> 00:17:36.020
That guy died, that's for sure.

00:17:36.020 --> 00:17:38.790
Huh?

00:17:38.790 --> 00:17:43.990
All is sorrow. All is hopelessness.
All is hatred.

00:17:48.130 --> 00:17:49.650
Big Brother...

00:17:53.070 --> 00:17:55.970
Let me show you...

00:17:55.970 --> 00:17:58.670
The real side of this world...

00:17:59.770 --> 00:18:01.210
Huh?

00:18:01.210 --> 00:18:05.270
Now... come here.

00:18:21.960 --> 00:18:24.100
Who is it?

00:18:24.100 --> 00:18:25.620
Magnum...

00:18:27.100 --> 00:18:28.300
...Break!

00:18:36.110 --> 00:18:37.310
Big Brother Iruga!

00:18:42.250 --> 00:18:45.850
He's not your brother.

00:18:45.850 --> 00:18:46.790
So foolish...

00:18:46.790 --> 00:18:48.310
What?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:55.650
That's not for you to decide.

00:19:00.130 --> 00:19:02.930
So... What will you do?

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:12.950
Yuufa!

00:19:15.280 --> 00:19:16.840
Pull yourself together!

00:19:17.850 --> 00:19:19.420
Don't do it, Yuufa!

00:19:19.420 --> 00:19:20.390
Roan...

00:19:20.390 --> 00:19:22.290
Yuufa, he's...

00:19:24.320 --> 00:19:26.760
What happened, Yuufa?

00:19:26.760 --> 00:19:28.960
--Big Brother-
--It's no good!

00:19:36.100 --> 00:19:36.970
Wait!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:26.680
Big Brother Iruga!

00:20:45.440 --> 00:20:47.030
That was...

00:20:48.740 --> 00:20:50.780
Yuufa!

00:20:50.780 --> 00:20:52.550
Was that...

00:20:52.550 --> 00:20:55.710
...really Big Brother Keough?

00:20:59.350 --> 00:21:02.810
Or was it...

00:21:22.880 --> 00:21:25.000
Thank you very much!

00:21:28.250 --> 00:21:31.650
Okay, it's been awhile, but let's make some money!

00:21:31.650 --> 00:21:33.920
Poring!

00:21:33.920 --> 00:21:36.010
Okay! Huh?

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:53.570
You're...

00:21:54.570 --> 00:21:55.640
Me?

00:21:55.640 --> 00:22:01.640
Yes... Do you... remember me?

00:22:05.090 --> 00:22:09.760
I see. Something bad has... ugh...

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:15.320
...happened in your hometown of Alberta... aah...

00:22:34.920 --> 00:22:44.910
<i>Unable to even find a way to</i> <i>regain the strength we lost</i>

00:22:45.890 --> 00:22:54.000
<i>Here we are, beneath this vast sky</i>

00:22:54.000 --> 00:22:58.840
<i>The shining cradle of green</i>

00:22:58.840 --> 00:23:03.710
<i>Is a merry-go-round that</i> <i>will never stop turning</i>

00:23:03.710 --> 00:23:08.480
<i>Greater than any jewel</i> <i>in this world</i>

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:12.820
<i>It is a precious treasure</i>

00:23:12.820 --> 00:23:22.820
<i>The endless journey leads</i> <i>to our tomorrow</i>

00:23:32.070 --> 00:23:34.140
<i>This is Solin of Kapra Service.</i>

00:23:34.140 --> 00:23:37.580
<i>Something sad has happened in Alberta.</i>

00:23:37.580 --> 00:23:39.680
<i>There is a new encounter.</i>

00:23:39.680 --> 00:23:42.050
<i>Next time: "Will You Comfort Me?"</i>

00:23:42.050 --> 00:23:44.680
<i>Until we meet again...</i>
